WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.667
Get to the outside meeting place in front of this house and stay there.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:05.867
Call 9-1-1.

00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:09.877
If someone is still inside, tell the operator where they are.

00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:11.077
Do not go back in.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:14.627
The fire department says when a home is safe to enter.

00:00:14.627 --> 00:00:16.368
This app cannot send firefighters.
